# Project Gotham Racing 2 (4D53004B), Thor, FIRST RUN: no PGR2 driver on the
# disk. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played.
#
# Evidence:
# - titlebench hands-off 240 s (0-0-y-1790413062-titlebench-14, Thor), one
#   frame per ~10 s in frames/: f02-f09 Bizarre logos, the driving warning
#   and the intro FMV (red Enzo with city names), f10 PGR2 splash, f11
#   "Loading", f12-f14 "PRESS START" (~120-140 s), f15-f24 attract races
#   ("Welcome to Hong Kong"). The FMV was not pressed at, so it may be
#   skippable earlier.
# - The menus past PRESS START are not on disk for PGR2. They are drafted from
#   PGR1 (same studio, Bizarre), which titleroutes played on the Thor
#   (nav sessions pgr.first-run-20260926T210321 and pgr.returning-...212324):
#   "load or create new" (create new driver: A) -> "setup driver", name
#   Player pre-filled, continue (A) -> "save to" hard disk (A) -> "progress
#   will be automatically saved" continue (A) -> main menu -> race type ->
#   skill level -> city -> car select -> AUTO transmission -> grid; RT drives.
#   PGR2's menu items differ from PGR1's (Kudos World Series, Arcade Racing,
#   Time Attack...); this draft takes the highlighted item at each step.
wait 60
shot boot60
press START                 # [guess] try to skip the intro FMV; harmless if it ignores it
wait 30
shot boot90
wait 30
shot boot120                # expect "PRESS START" [seen f12-f14]
mark booted
press START                 # [seen f12] title; must come before the attract (~150 s) or it starts a demo
wait 8
shot load-or-create         # [PGR1] create new driver highlighted when there is none
press A
wait 6
shot setup-driver           # [PGR1] name "Player" pre-filled, continue at the bottom
press A                     # OPEN: PGR1 needed only A here; if the cursor sits on "driver name", flick down to continue
wait 6
shot save-to                # [PGR1] hard disk
press A
wait 6
shot autosave-notice        # [PGR1] "progress will be automatically saved", continue
press A
wait 6
mark profile-saved
shot main-menu
press A                     # [guess] highlighted race type
wait 6
shot race-type
press A
wait 6
shot series-or-city
press A
wait 6
shot event
press A
wait 6
shot car-select
press A
wait 5
shot transmission           # [PGR1] AUTO highlighted
press A
wait 25
shot loading
wait 10
shot grid
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame on the grid with the HUD
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 3
}
